WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:40.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:41.105 --> 01:41.945
Zheng Yu.

3
01:45.465 --> 01:49.985
You must want to know what happened during the immunology exam.

4
02:00.145 --> 02:01.905
I know who threw the paper ball.

5
02:01.985 --> 02:02.825
I saw it.

6
02:05.705 --> 02:06.865
Who?

7
02:09.665 --> 02:10.985
We shouldn't talk here.

8
02:11.065 --> 02:12.425
Let's go somewhere else.

9
02:14.865 --> 02:17.865
I know a nice restaurant nearby. It's my treat.

10
02:24.585 --> 02:25.665
Let's talk here.

11
02:25.745 --> 02:27.265
Who threw the paper ball?

12
02:28.265 --> 02:29.625
I will tell you.

13
02:30.865 --> 02:33.865
However, I hope you can agree to one condition.

14
02:34.945 --> 02:36.105
It's nothing difficult.

15
02:36.705 --> 02:39.345
From now on, I hope you won't block my calls.

16
02:40.705 --> 02:43.665
I have limited call credits. Just contact me on WeChat.

17
02:44.265 --> 02:46.425
You've muted notifications from me, haven't you?

18
02:47.265 --> 02:48.265
You never reply.

19
02:54.145 --> 02:56.665
UNMUTE NOTIFICATIONS

20
03:01.785 --> 03:02.985
Now can you tell me?

21
03:03.065 --> 03:04.105
It was Sun Dongchao.

22
03:06.825 --> 03:07.985
Why would he do that?

23
03:08.065 --> 03:09.505
To frame someone.

24
03:10.305 --> 03:11.865
I don't get it.

25
03:11.945 --> 03:14.425
I would understand if he threw the ball at me.

26
03:15.425 --> 03:17.385
What does he have against Chen Yanzhou?

27
03:20.105 --> 03:23.505
So he meant to throw the paper ball at me.

28
03:24.825 --> 03:26.185
That's right.

29
03:26.265 --> 03:27.585
During exam week,

30
03:27.665 --> 03:30.585
Sun Dongchao told a few of his close friends

31
03:30.665 --> 03:33.425
that he would teach you a lesson during the final exam.

32
03:33.505 --> 03:34.945
In the end,

33
03:35.865 --> 03:37.185
he threw it too hard.

34
03:45.505 --> 03:48.185
So he knew that was a surveillance blind spot.

35
03:49.905 --> 03:52.585
Our sophomore ecology course was in that old classroom.

36
03:54.465 --> 03:55.625
You might not remember.

37
03:55.705 --> 03:58.545
Sun Dongchao was absent more than three times.

38
03:58.625 --> 04:00.185
Mr. Qin failed him.

39
04:00.825 --> 04:01.785
I don't remember.

40
04:02.505 --> 04:03.665
Sun Dongchao denied it,

41
04:03.745 --> 04:07.505
forcing Mr. Qin to check the footage to prove his absences.

42
04:07.585 --> 04:10.585
Turns out the classroom surveillance has a blind spot.

43
04:11.185 --> 04:12.185
He got away with it.

44
04:16.105 --> 04:20.465
If not for fear that people would use this to ruin your competition chances,

45
04:20.545 --> 04:22.025
I wouldn't have revealed this.

46
04:23.305 --> 04:26.465
Chen Yanzhou offers bribes and uses his connections.

47
04:27.345 --> 04:29.785
What becomes of him is none of my concern.

48
04:32.785 --> 04:35.025
So that text was from you.

49
04:37.225 --> 04:38.785
I just saw it by chance.

50
04:42.865 --> 04:44.305
If it wasn't anonymous,

51
04:44.385 --> 04:46.625
would you have listened to me?

52
04:47.385 --> 04:48.345
It was for your own good.

53
04:49.545 --> 04:51.545
Really? Good in what way?

54
04:54.985 --> 04:57.585
When Sun Dongchao called me a pushover in the dorm,

55
04:57.665 --> 04:58.905
you ran over to tell me.

56
04:59.745 --> 05:01.545
When he wanted to frame me,

57
05:01.625 --> 05:03.225
why didn't you warn me?

58
05:04.745 --> 05:05.945
Or is it that

59
05:06.545 --> 05:08.105
you wanted to see me framed,

60
05:08.185 --> 05:10.545
see me fail,

61
05:10.625 --> 05:11.905
and then play the hero?

62
05:13.225 --> 05:14.225
Zheng Yu,

63
05:15.065 --> 05:16.585
you're really overthinking it.

64
05:18.265 --> 05:21.945
I thought he was just bluffing. I didn't think he would follow through.

65
05:24.665 --> 05:27.265
I'd like to think you're better than this.

66
05:31.345 --> 05:34.025
But the thought of Sun Dongchao getting away with it

67
05:34.105 --> 05:35.665
and enjoying his winter break

68
05:37.225 --> 05:38.785
doesn't sit well with me.

69
05:38.865 --> 05:39.985
Don't worry.

70
05:40.665 --> 05:42.985
I will tell everything to the advisor

71
05:43.785 --> 05:45.265
and make him pay the price.

72
05:47.505 --> 05:48.625
Do it now.

73
05:48.705 --> 05:50.345
I need to see her anyway.

74
05:50.985 --> 05:51.945
Zheng Yu,

75
05:52.585 --> 05:55.985
do you not trust me, or do you want to keep an eye on me?

76
05:56.585 --> 05:59.625
I have to turn in my financial aid verification form.

77
05:59.705 --> 06:02.265
My financial aid is far more important than this.

78
06:03.905 --> 06:05.065
Let's go.

79
06:10.185 --> 06:14.345
So Sun Dongchao originally meant to throw the paper ball to Zheng Yu.

80
06:17.385 --> 06:20.225
Why didn't you tell me when I asked you about this before?

81
06:21.505 --> 06:24.585
Sun Dongchao warned everyone not to tell.

82
06:28.385 --> 06:30.505
But I don't want him to escape punishment.

83
06:30.585 --> 06:32.345
What if he does worse later?

84
06:32.425 --> 06:34.385
So after thinking about it,

85
06:34.465 --> 06:36.145
I decided to come forward.

86
06:37.985 --> 06:39.185
Got it.

87
06:42.265 --> 06:44.865
However, right now,

88
06:44.945 --> 06:47.425
it's just your testimony.

89
06:47.505 --> 06:50.625
If Sun Dongchao doesn't admit it, our hands will still be tied.

90
06:51.385 --> 06:53.665
Others in the class heard him say it.

91
06:53.745 --> 06:56.265
If necessary, I can help get in touch with them.

92
06:59.225 --> 07:01.585
2024 FALL SEMESTER EXAM SEATING CHART

93
07:03.185 --> 07:05.865
On the day of the exam, was the rear door left open?

94
07:08.545 --> 07:09.705
I'll top up your phone.

95
07:13.585 --> 07:15.425
Zheng Yu, what do you need?

96
07:16.265 --> 07:17.785
I'm turning in my form.

97
07:17.865 --> 07:18.905
Put it on my desk.

98
07:21.025 --> 07:24.465
I was quite worried that you were too withdrawn.

99
07:24.545 --> 07:28.425
Now I'm glad to see you and Xie Yudi getting along so well.

100
07:28.505 --> 07:30.105
He and I have no relationship.

101
07:33.305 --> 07:34.945
I said too much.

102
07:35.025 --> 07:36.545
I have to get going.

103
07:36.625 --> 07:38.585
Just put the form on my desk.

104
07:54.865 --> 07:57.825
FROM: ZHENG YU SUMMARY OF NETWORKING EVENT

105
08:12.505 --> 08:15.825
UNIVERSITY FINANCIAL AID VERIFICATION FORM STUDENT: ZHENG YU

106
08:15.905 --> 08:18.105
MOM IN VEGETATIVE STATE, NO INCOME

107
08:20.665 --> 08:22.385
MOM WAS SEVERELY INJURED IN A CAR CRASH

108
08:22.465 --> 08:24.025
TREATMENT USED UP ALL SAVINGS

109
08:24.105 --> 08:25.705
NO ASSETS NO RELATIVES PROVIDING AID

110
08:37.345 --> 08:38.865
-You-- -Shut up.

111
08:52.825 --> 08:55.305
Chen Yanzhou, are you at the campus?

112
08:55.385 --> 08:57.665
There has been a conclusion to the cheating incident.

113
09:06.105 --> 09:09.905
T5-201 CORRIDOR-01

114
09:12.665 --> 09:14.145
Did Sun Dongchao admit it?

115
09:14.225 --> 09:15.785
When he got the call from me,

116
09:15.865 --> 09:17.305
he confessed everything.

117
09:17.385 --> 09:18.625
He may have done this,

118
09:18.705 --> 09:20.865
but he has very little guts.

119
09:20.945 --> 09:23.025
Besides, the timing matches up.

120
09:23.945 --> 09:26.985
Tomorrow, the university will issue a statement

121
09:27.065 --> 09:28.505
to clear your name

122
09:29.185 --> 09:31.905
and disclose the disciplinary action against Sun Dongchao.

123
09:33.145 --> 09:34.665
Sorry for the trouble lately.

124
09:35.425 --> 09:36.505
I didn't do much.

125
09:36.585 --> 09:38.705
You should thank Xie Yudi.

126
09:40.665 --> 09:42.025
Xie Yudi?

127
09:42.105 --> 09:44.025
How long have you been in this class?

128
09:44.105 --> 09:46.065
Don't tell me you don't know who he is.

129
09:48.025 --> 09:49.905
I think I vaguely know who he is.

130
09:49.985 --> 09:52.265
I just don't understand why he helped me.

131
09:52.345 --> 09:54.025
That's because…

132
09:54.105 --> 09:56.265
He and I have no relationship.

133
09:57.345 --> 10:00.625
That's because you're all classmates. Helping each other is normal.

134
10:04.545 --> 10:06.705
Miss, when will the award money be issued?

135
10:06.785 --> 10:08.705
Do you mean the Vitality Award?

136
10:08.785 --> 10:10.065
The teachers are on break.

137
10:10.145 --> 10:12.265
It won't be until next semester.

138
10:12.345 --> 10:13.385
Don't worry.

139
10:13.465 --> 10:15.665
You're securely in the number one spot.

140
10:16.305 --> 10:18.345
I mean the first-class scholarship.

141
10:19.265 --> 10:20.905
That's also postponed.

142
10:21.945 --> 10:23.705
You've never cared about the money.

143
10:25.945 --> 10:27.465
What if someone needs money?

144
10:28.545 --> 10:29.705
What did you say?

145
10:30.505 --> 10:31.745
Nothing.

146
10:31.825 --> 10:33.105
Well, I'm going to go now.

147
10:33.185 --> 10:34.305
Okay.

148
10:41.185 --> 10:43.425
SCHOLARSHIP AWARD CEREMONY FOR LOW-INCOME STUDENTS

149
10:44.025 --> 10:46.225
Is this photo newly put up?

150
10:47.225 --> 10:48.185
I never noticed it.

151
10:48.825 --> 10:50.145
It's over two years old.

152
10:51.385 --> 10:53.825
You usually come here for academic matters.

153
10:54.625 --> 10:56.705
It's normal if you've never noticed it.

154
10:59.825 --> 11:06.105
SCHOLARSHIP AWARD CEREMONY FOR LOW-INCOME STUDENTS

155
11:09.945 --> 11:12.865
I DIDN'T MEAN TO LOOK AT IT

156
11:18.345 --> 11:20.585
Doesn't that sound too defensive?

157
11:34.265 --> 11:37.585
NOW THE PE CLASS IS OVER, I HAVEN'T HAD TIME TO DO ANY ROLLERBLADING

158
11:40.665 --> 11:41.945
That seems a bit forced.

159
11:49.305 --> 11:50.865
RECALL MESSAGE

160
11:52.425 --> 11:55.145
Your dad cut up some fruit. Eat some.

161
11:57.865 --> 11:59.625
I have good news.

162
11:59.705 --> 12:02.025
Final grades are out. I'm ranked first overall.

163
12:02.625 --> 12:03.865
Really?

164
12:04.465 --> 12:05.505
Unfortunately…

165
12:06.105 --> 12:07.145
What's wrong?

166
12:07.225 --> 12:09.945
The scholarship won't be disbursed until next semester.

167
12:10.025 --> 12:12.385
Otherwise, I could take you out to buy a gift.

168
12:13.105 --> 12:15.345
I thought you were going to say something else.

169
12:16.625 --> 12:19.145
All I want is for everything to go well for you.

170
12:20.225 --> 12:22.905
You've been so busy since you returned to university.

171
12:22.985 --> 12:24.385
Be mindful of your health.

172
12:26.385 --> 12:27.465
Since you're on break,

173
12:27.545 --> 12:29.705
why don't you get another checkup?

174
12:30.865 --> 12:32.545
Another checkup?

175
12:32.625 --> 12:33.865
See Dr. Li.

176
12:35.025 --> 12:35.865
Okay.

177
12:38.745 --> 12:41.545
Is there a rehab center behind the hospital?

178
12:42.625 --> 12:44.825
I think so. Why do you ask?

179
12:57.905 --> 12:59.025
Thank you.

180
13:04.665 --> 13:07.145
CORE INTRODUCTION TO REHABILITATION THERAPY

181
13:10.785 --> 13:12.185
Which ward are you going to?

182
13:12.785 --> 13:14.625
I know this building well.

183
13:14.705 --> 13:16.145
I don't know which ward.

184
13:16.745 --> 13:18.865
Do you at least know the patient's name?

185
13:19.705 --> 13:22.305
I only know the name of the patient's family member.

186
14:00.585 --> 14:02.745
I think I did something stupid.

187
14:03.625 --> 14:05.025
Before coming,

188
14:05.585 --> 14:08.385
I thought to buy some fruit to visit the patient.

189
14:10.265 --> 14:13.305
-But… -It's no big deal.

190
14:14.625 --> 14:18.065
I've never seen any friends visit Xiaozheng.

191
14:18.745 --> 14:21.265
If her mom is aware,

192
14:21.345 --> 14:24.025
I bet your presence here

193
14:24.105 --> 14:27.505
makes her happier than eating fruit.

194
14:30.825 --> 14:33.105
Does Zheng Yu come every day?

195
14:33.185 --> 14:34.705
Not necessarily.

196
14:34.785 --> 14:37.665
When she's busy, she doesn't come often.

197
14:37.745 --> 14:39.865
I haven't seen her for a few days.

198
14:40.665 --> 14:43.985
I heard she didn't get some scholarship.

199
14:45.305 --> 14:46.985
What was it called?

200
14:50.185 --> 14:51.225
The Vitality Award.

201
14:51.305 --> 14:55.625
She worked so hard but ended up not getting it.

202
14:56.265 --> 14:58.305
She must be terribly upset.

203
15:00.585 --> 15:02.345
And that student in number one

204
15:02.425 --> 15:04.585
came out of nowhere.

205
15:04.665 --> 15:05.825
In the past two years,

206
15:05.905 --> 15:08.305
I didn't hear her mention them.

207
15:14.225 --> 15:17.105
Since Zheng Yu isn't here today, I'll be going.

208
15:17.185 --> 15:18.425
So soon?

209
15:19.585 --> 15:22.265
-Thank you for showing me the way today. -Don't mention it.

210
15:22.345 --> 15:23.785
Just like Xiaozheng,

211
15:23.865 --> 15:25.225
call me Ms. Yang.

212
15:26.785 --> 15:28.025
Oh, right.

213
15:28.625 --> 15:31.065
Ms. Yang, why don't I give this to you?

214
15:32.105 --> 15:33.625
Thank you for your efforts.

215
15:34.505 --> 15:35.545
Okay.

216
15:35.625 --> 15:36.585
Well,

217
15:37.305 --> 15:40.905
I guess if you take this with you, you will probably feel bad.

218
15:42.105 --> 15:43.625
Well then, I'm going now.

219
15:44.745 --> 15:46.025
Xiaochen.

220
15:48.345 --> 15:50.145
My favorite fruit

221
15:50.225 --> 15:51.505
is actually waxberries.

222
15:53.425 --> 15:56.185
Waxberries are a summer fruit and aren't available now.

223
15:56.785 --> 15:59.345
Then continue being friends with Xiaozheng,

224
15:59.425 --> 16:01.505
at least until summer.

225
16:02.585 --> 16:05.505
Then I'll get to eat waxberries from you.

226
16:06.585 --> 16:08.225
Come visit often.

227
16:09.825 --> 16:10.865
Okay.

228
16:25.625 --> 16:27.065
It's her, isn't it?

229
16:27.145 --> 16:28.545
Zheng Yu.

230
16:29.145 --> 16:30.305
-It's her! -It is! Stop!

231
16:30.385 --> 16:31.345
Stop running!

232
16:31.425 --> 16:32.425
Stop!

233
16:34.305 --> 16:35.505
Stop!

234
16:38.865 --> 16:39.985
Have a death wish?

235
16:42.185 --> 16:43.265
-Stop! -Sir, drive.

236
16:43.945 --> 16:45.585
-Stop! -Stop!

237
16:48.265 --> 16:49.625
Goddamn it.

238
16:57.065 --> 16:58.785
WU FA

239
17:02.705 --> 17:04.785
Zheng Yu, listen up.

240
17:04.865 --> 17:05.905
Running is useless.

241
17:05.985 --> 17:07.785
I'll always find you!

242
17:08.505 --> 17:10.704
The 30,000 yuan disbursement is postponed.

243
17:11.585 --> 17:13.184
When next semester starts,

244
17:13.265 --> 17:14.745
I will send it to you in full.

245
17:14.825 --> 17:16.944
Do you think I'd still believe you?

246
17:17.025 --> 17:18.704
Believe what you want.

247
17:18.785 --> 17:20.025
Five days.

248
17:20.105 --> 17:22.065
I will give you another five days.

249
17:22.145 --> 17:24.464
After five days, if you're missing a cent,

250
17:24.545 --> 17:26.745
I will pay your mother a visit.

251
17:33.265 --> 17:34.305
At the lab,

252
17:35.305 --> 17:36.945
were you on the phone with this guy?

253
17:38.065 --> 17:38.905
What?

254
17:41.225 --> 17:42.185
Nothing.

255
17:45.145 --> 17:46.545
I'm warning you.

256
17:46.625 --> 17:49.665
Don't tell anyone about this,

257
17:49.745 --> 17:51.745
especially people at the university.

258
17:51.825 --> 17:54.105
Don't worry. I don't have time for gossip.

259
18:03.185 --> 18:04.385
THE 12TH, 13TH FIVE-YEAR PLAN

260
18:04.465 --> 18:07.625
She worked so hard but ended up not getting it.

261
18:08.625 --> 18:11.505
She must be terribly upset.

262
18:11.585 --> 18:13.025
Why were you here?

263
18:15.705 --> 18:17.065
I went to get a checkup.

264
18:18.705 --> 18:20.745
-Where are you headed? -The convenience store.

265
18:21.665 --> 18:23.505
Just drop me off anywhere.

266
18:25.065 --> 18:27.425
I'm going to the lab. It's on the way.

267
18:38.665 --> 18:41.825
CONFIRM ROUTE CHANGE

268
18:59.065 --> 19:00.465
Continue to Lefu Yayuan.

269
19:00.545 --> 19:01.465
Okay.

270
19:23.025 --> 19:23.865
What the heck?

271
19:23.945 --> 19:25.385
Didn't you see me here?

272
19:25.465 --> 19:26.625
I…

273
19:27.305 --> 19:29.665
Think you're so cool, getting dropped off at work?

274
19:30.225 --> 19:31.985
Stop thinking about slacking off.

275
19:37.625 --> 19:40.225
Can I get this month's wages in advance?

276
19:41.265 --> 19:42.945
Do you have to pay on dates?

277
19:47.345 --> 19:48.865
I need it urgently.

278
19:48.945 --> 19:49.945
It doesn't matter.

279
19:50.545 --> 19:52.505
Even bank loans collect interest.

280
19:52.585 --> 19:54.745
I run a convenience store, not a charity.

281
19:56.425 --> 19:58.505
Don't assume I don't do good deeds.

282
19:58.585 --> 20:01.185
I give up my seat and help seniors cross the street.

283
20:01.265 --> 20:03.945
I do all sorts of good with one exception.

284
20:04.025 --> 20:06.105
I don't do good deeds that cost money.

285
20:07.225 --> 20:08.465
I only

286
20:08.545 --> 20:09.945
do free good deeds.

287
20:12.425 --> 20:13.265
Got it.

288
20:22.585 --> 20:25.185
I can't give you an advance,

289
20:25.905 --> 20:27.385
but I can arrange more shifts.

290
20:27.465 --> 20:29.545
That will increase your income.

291
20:29.625 --> 20:31.705
I won't come tomorrow. You watch the shop.

292
20:31.785 --> 20:32.625
Not tomorrow.

293
20:32.705 --> 20:33.785
I have tutoring.

294
21:02.665 --> 21:04.145
Flowers cost 300 yuan.

295
21:04.225 --> 21:06.385
You sent me 300 yuan this morning.

296
21:06.465 --> 21:08.265
You're missing the errand fee.

297
21:08.345 --> 21:09.585
This is the receipt.

298
21:10.305 --> 21:12.625
My phone is charging inside.

299
21:13.825 --> 21:15.505
Here's a flower as payment.

300
21:16.665 --> 21:19.225
There. It costs more than 20 yuan.

301
21:22.825 --> 21:23.705
Anything else?

302
21:24.665 --> 21:27.785
I tutored for ten days this month, 40 hours in total.

303
21:27.865 --> 21:29.505
I want to settle that in advance.

304
21:32.385 --> 21:35.025
For the past half year, all payments were monthly.

305
21:35.105 --> 21:37.025
Now you suddenly propose this today.

306
21:37.105 --> 21:39.225
Do you have any integrity?

307
21:40.025 --> 21:41.225
You may have forgotten.

308
21:41.305 --> 21:43.305
Half a year ago, we agreed on daily pay.

309
21:43.385 --> 21:45.465
I have the chat history.

310
21:45.545 --> 21:47.385
You felt monthly was more convenient,

311
21:47.465 --> 21:49.145
so you unilaterally decided on it.

312
21:49.745 --> 21:51.425
I urgently need money now.

313
21:51.505 --> 21:54.545
This money is for my legitimate services.

314
21:55.545 --> 21:57.545
Do you want to settle the score now?

315
21:57.625 --> 22:00.145
Fine. Let's make things clear.

316
22:04.545 --> 22:07.025
These are all videos of your lessons at our house.

317
22:07.105 --> 22:07.945
Come take a look.

318
22:15.105 --> 22:16.345
You didn't inform me

319
22:16.425 --> 22:17.545
about a camera.

320
22:17.625 --> 22:19.345
Why should I tell you?

321
22:19.425 --> 22:20.545
I pay for your time.

322
22:20.625 --> 22:22.305
Why can't I monitor you?

323
22:22.385 --> 22:24.625
Don't you want to settle the score? Go ahead.

324
22:26.705 --> 22:27.585
Come on.

325
22:29.705 --> 22:30.825
On November 8th,

326
22:30.905 --> 22:33.865
you tutored for four hours and used the toilet twice.

327
22:33.945 --> 22:35.945
Didn't I tell you before

328
22:36.025 --> 22:37.825
not to drink too much water?

329
22:37.905 --> 22:39.025
I'm a germaphobe.

330
22:39.105 --> 22:41.625
I don't like others using our bathroom.

331
22:41.705 --> 22:44.065
On November 23rd, at 3:15 p.m.,

332
22:44.145 --> 22:46.225
Xiaojie ate snacks in his room.

333
22:46.305 --> 22:48.985
Didn't I tell you not to let him eat that junk?

334
22:49.065 --> 22:50.585
Did you remind him?

335
22:51.185 --> 22:53.025
On November 29th, you took 15 minutes

336
22:53.105 --> 22:54.265
to explain one problem.

337
22:54.345 --> 22:57.985
He still didn't get it. Shouldn't you reflect on that?

338
22:58.065 --> 23:01.025
These failures are grounds for zero payment this month.

339
23:01.105 --> 23:05.545
I can also make sure that this area's tutoring circle shuts you out.

340
23:08.625 --> 23:09.785
Nothing to say now?

341
23:10.945 --> 23:13.225
I didn't actually want to nitpick.

342
23:13.305 --> 23:16.225
If you realize your problems today,

343
23:16.305 --> 23:17.625
I can put it behind us.

344
23:17.705 --> 23:20.025
If you insist on settling the score,

345
23:20.105 --> 23:21.305
don't force my hand.

346
23:24.265 --> 23:25.345
Pay me.

347
23:26.945 --> 23:28.385
Do you not understand?

348
23:28.465 --> 23:30.105
I'm not giving you anything!

349
23:30.705 --> 23:32.825
Did your ledger record this?

350
23:32.905 --> 23:34.025
October 24th.

351
23:34.905 --> 23:36.345
My last-minute overtime.

352
23:41.305 --> 23:43.785
You added me to Pan Jie's school parent group.

353
23:43.865 --> 23:47.185
You said checking homework kept you from your beauty sleep.

354
23:49.265 --> 23:50.345
What's your point?

355
23:52.785 --> 23:54.625
If I can't get the money

356
23:54.705 --> 23:56.625
and can't find a new job nearby,

357
23:58.745 --> 23:59.905
I'll have to try here.

358
24:18.385 --> 24:20.385
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

359
24:25.865 --> 24:27.985
Zheng Yu.

360
24:34.985 --> 24:37.945
Hello? Sorry, I didn't check my phone.

361
24:38.585 --> 24:41.505
I have translated two-thirds of the document you wanted.

362
24:43.225 --> 24:44.545
Tomorrow?

363
24:44.625 --> 24:46.345
I don't think that's feasible.

364
24:46.425 --> 24:48.025
My laptop isn't working.

365
24:50.665 --> 24:52.825
Okay, I'll send it to you in a bit.

366
24:53.625 --> 24:54.665
Thank you.

367
25:05.305 --> 25:07.665
Does Jiang Haixing know you came to see me?

368
25:08.705 --> 25:10.825
He's drinking at a friend's place tonight.

369
25:11.505 --> 25:12.585
In this exam,

370
25:13.585 --> 25:15.105
I ranked second in my grade.

371
25:16.585 --> 25:17.705
I improved.

372
25:18.705 --> 25:19.545
That's great.

373
25:21.265 --> 25:22.425
Zheng Yu,

374
25:22.505 --> 25:24.825
how have you been lately?

375
25:26.545 --> 25:27.745
The same as usual.

376
25:29.985 --> 25:33.865
I didn't go to the hospital this semester, afraid Jiang Haixing would find out.

377
25:34.665 --> 25:36.305
His nose is sharper than a dog's.

378
25:36.905 --> 25:40.585
Last time, he smelled the disinfectant on me

379
25:40.665 --> 25:42.185
and went mad at the hospital.

380
25:43.065 --> 25:44.785
Does he treat you well?

381
25:44.865 --> 25:46.465
Do you have enough money?

382
25:47.505 --> 25:48.745
It's all right.

383
25:49.465 --> 25:51.065
Whenever I need something,

384
25:51.145 --> 25:53.185
I tell him, and he buys it for me.

385
25:56.345 --> 25:58.345
He's afraid you will give me the money.

386
26:00.265 --> 26:01.985
Are there too many hospital bills?

387
26:03.105 --> 26:05.265
Or did those people come to Qingyi?

388
26:05.945 --> 26:07.385
No.

389
26:07.465 --> 26:08.505
Go home and rest.

390
26:08.585 --> 26:09.585
I have things to do.

391
26:09.665 --> 26:11.385
Zheng Yu, wait.

392
26:13.465 --> 26:15.785
Did you bring your laptop?

393
26:23.985 --> 26:27.665
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

394
26:33.265 --> 26:34.345
Where have you been?

395
26:34.425 --> 26:35.865
I went to see a classmate.

396
26:35.945 --> 26:37.105
What classmate?

397
26:37.185 --> 26:38.305
Our academic rep.

398
26:38.385 --> 26:41.105
I borrowed study materials and also got dinner.

399
26:41.185 --> 26:42.025
What subject?

400
26:48.825 --> 26:49.945
Physics.

401
26:51.745 --> 26:52.865
Physics, okay.

402
26:52.945 --> 26:54.585
I was good at physics.

403
26:55.265 --> 26:56.185
Listen up.

404
26:56.785 --> 26:59.065
Don't go where you shouldn't go.

405
26:59.145 --> 27:00.945
You're my son.

406
27:01.025 --> 27:03.505
My son shouldn't be filial to others.

407
27:03.585 --> 27:04.745
Got it?

408
27:06.825 --> 27:09.505
This laptop isn't working. Can you take a look?

409
27:09.585 --> 27:11.545
Whose is it? The academic rep?

410
27:12.465 --> 27:15.625
He needs it repaired, and since I'm borrowing his materials,

411
27:15.705 --> 27:17.385
I brought it for you to check.

412
27:18.865 --> 27:20.065
ON CHEN YANZHOU

413
27:20.145 --> 27:22.305
This is frozen.

414
27:22.385 --> 27:24.105
"On Chen Yanzhou"?

415
27:26.905 --> 27:29.025
My classmate's name is Chen Yanzhou.

416
27:30.625 --> 27:32.905
This is quite old.

417
27:32.985 --> 27:35.305
Is there water damage? It could be fried.

418
27:35.905 --> 27:38.225
No, and he doesn't know what happened.

419
27:39.105 --> 27:41.145
It's okay if you can't fix it.

420
27:41.225 --> 27:44.105
It is very old. I shouldn't have told him you could fix it.

421
27:45.145 --> 27:47.065
I'll just give it back to him.

422
27:47.145 --> 27:48.345
Child,

423
27:48.425 --> 27:50.145
I didn't say I couldn't fix it.

424
27:50.225 --> 27:51.785
I have to open it up.

425
27:52.785 --> 27:54.145
How much will it cost?

426
27:55.225 --> 27:56.345
I'll tell him.

427
27:57.665 --> 28:00.105
You're fixing it for your classmate.

428
28:00.185 --> 28:02.905
Asking for repair fees will make us look so stingy.

429
28:04.145 --> 28:07.305
Establish good relationships with these top students.

430
28:07.385 --> 28:10.185
If you ever have difficulties, they can help you out.

431
28:10.865 --> 28:12.705
These are social skills.

432
28:12.785 --> 28:14.145
I'll go do homework now.

433
28:15.945 --> 28:17.545
You're so forgetful.

434
28:17.625 --> 28:19.865
FAST REPAIRS OF PHONES AND DIGITAL DEVICES

435
28:52.905 --> 28:53.865
Coming.

436
28:55.505 --> 28:58.465
Hi, I'm the tutor who was referred by the Mingsi Training Agency.

437
28:58.545 --> 28:59.945
My name is Zheng Yu.

438
29:00.465 --> 29:01.705
Wait.

439
29:01.785 --> 29:02.745
Sorry.

440
29:07.545 --> 29:08.705
Here.

441
29:13.465 --> 29:16.025
Why are you standing there? Change into slippers.

442
29:16.105 --> 29:18.545
Your feet will freeze in those thin shoes.

443
29:24.465 --> 29:25.665
Come in.

444
29:29.225 --> 29:30.145
Thank you.

445
29:39.625 --> 29:41.745
They're my daughter's and are a bit small.

446
29:41.825 --> 29:43.105
Bear with them for now.

447
29:44.625 --> 29:47.265
I read the resume that the agent sent.

448
29:47.345 --> 29:48.825
I'm very satisfied.

449
29:48.905 --> 29:51.145
Unfortunately, I don't get the last say.

450
29:51.745 --> 29:53.505
Spend some time with my daughter.

451
29:53.585 --> 29:55.745
Whether we end up hiring you or not,

452
29:55.825 --> 29:58.545
I will still pay you for your time today.

453
29:58.625 --> 29:59.945
What is her name?

454
30:00.625 --> 30:02.665
Gao Xing, a first-year in senior high.

455
30:18.385 --> 30:20.505
Are you the new tutor?

456
30:38.785 --> 30:39.865
Open this for me.

457
30:47.345 --> 30:49.065
I forgot to say, it's carbonated.

458
30:49.145 --> 30:51.025
It will release carbon dioxide.

459
30:52.505 --> 30:53.865
Drink it, and let's begin.

460
31:10.505 --> 31:12.825
If you tutor me, can you make me number one?

461
31:12.905 --> 31:15.465
What did you rank in your finals this time?

462
31:16.785 --> 31:18.505
Thirty-fifth.

463
31:18.585 --> 31:20.065
-In your grade? -In my class.

464
31:25.825 --> 31:27.625
Then I can't.

465
31:28.865 --> 31:31.465
Then this is the last lesson you give me.

466
31:54.545 --> 31:55.865
Ms. Xiaozheng.

467
31:58.145 --> 32:00.065
Did Gao Xing cause any trouble?

468
32:00.145 --> 32:01.065
No.

469
32:01.665 --> 32:04.265
That's good. I calculated the time.

470
32:05.265 --> 32:06.785
Is it not time yet?

471
32:06.865 --> 32:08.225
We started at 4:00 p.m. sharp.

472
32:09.065 --> 32:10.825
You went over by 20 minutes.

473
32:10.905 --> 32:12.385
Look, it's dark outside.

474
32:13.425 --> 32:16.145
I'll pay you one-third more based on your hourly rate.

475
32:18.345 --> 32:19.785
All right, sent.

476
32:22.065 --> 32:23.225
Also,

477
32:24.185 --> 32:25.425
regarding tutoring,

478
32:25.505 --> 32:27.705
I still need to ask Gao Xing for her opinion.

479
32:27.785 --> 32:28.785
Let's keep in touch.

480
32:31.545 --> 32:32.785
I'll see you out.

481
32:41.145 --> 32:43.345
I'll throw this on my way out.

482
32:44.945 --> 32:46.145
Thank you.

483
32:49.745 --> 32:51.025
Be careful.

484
32:57.025 --> 32:58.065
The pizza is cold.

485
32:59.185 --> 33:00.265
I'll heat it up.

486
33:01.025 --> 33:02.385
What do you think of her?

487
33:03.305 --> 33:04.225
Nothing much.

488
33:15.785 --> 33:17.945
ZHENG YU, QING YI UNIVERSITY COLLEGE OF LIFE SCIENCES

489
33:20.465 --> 33:21.625
GPA: 3.9 (TOP 5% OF MAJOR)

490
33:21.705 --> 33:23.785
NATIONAL SCHOLARSHIP RECIPIENT VITALITY AWARD WINNER

491
33:25.665 --> 33:26.865
Gao Xing.

492
33:28.225 --> 33:30.625
I don't have time to take you to school tomorrow.

493
33:30.705 --> 33:32.065
Can you go on your own?

494
33:33.505 --> 33:35.065
Haven't I always?

495
33:42.025 --> 33:44.225
ZHENG YU

496
33:44.305 --> 33:47.305
HIGH SCHOOL AFFILIATED WITH QING YI UNIVERSITY

497
33:47.385 --> 33:48.785
My bike is at school.

498
33:48.865 --> 33:50.225
I'll bike home today.

499
33:50.305 --> 33:52.705
You don't have to pick me up. Bye.

500
34:02.265 --> 34:03.345
Son!

501
34:04.345 --> 34:05.265
Slow down.

502
34:10.385 --> 34:13.185
It's winter. Your hands will freeze when biking.

503
34:13.264 --> 34:14.824
I bought new gloves for you.

504
34:14.905 --> 34:17.264
They're made with the best fiber and hand-knit.

505
34:17.344 --> 34:18.505
They're warm and soft.

506
34:18.585 --> 34:20.425
-Try them on. -Okay.

507
34:21.304 --> 34:23.065
We're finally on break,

508
34:23.145 --> 34:25.784
but we have to come to school to get our transcripts.

509
34:26.385 --> 34:28.945
Didn't you say you would ask the teacher for leave?

510
34:29.025 --> 34:32.065
He didn't approve it and insisted I come to school.

511
34:32.145 --> 34:33.465
He was so mysterious.

512
34:33.545 --> 34:37.425
I couldn't catch a cab during rush hour and had to squeeze onto the bus.

513
34:37.505 --> 34:41.665
Not only were there no seats, but the heater was down.

514
34:41.744 --> 34:43.744
Look how frozen my hands are.

515
34:47.905 --> 34:50.505
Isn't that Jiang Mian from Year 2, Class 8?

516
34:50.585 --> 34:53.105
That must be his dad next to him.

517
34:53.185 --> 34:54.545
Good, it fits well.

518
34:56.784 --> 35:00.225
Who else but me, your dad, would care about you so much?

519
35:02.585 --> 35:04.505
Your good-for-nothing sister?

520
35:05.105 --> 35:08.185
You'll be lucky if she doesn't ruin your life.

521
35:10.865 --> 35:11.985
I'm going.

522
35:18.465 --> 35:19.625
Bye.

523
36:00.025 --> 36:04.185
Good morning, teachers and students.

524
36:04.265 --> 36:06.625
-Another semester draws to an end. -Hey, Jiahuan.

525
36:06.705 --> 36:09.505
-Bring this in for me. -First, on behalf of the school…

526
36:09.585 --> 36:10.825
Where are you going?

527
36:10.905 --> 36:12.385
Building good karma for exams.

528
36:12.465 --> 36:16.665
We sincerely thank all the teachers who work tirelessly and selflessly.

529
36:16.745 --> 36:20.345
At the same time, I want to extend my congratulations

530
36:20.425 --> 36:22.905
to all the students determined to succeed.

531
36:22.985 --> 36:24.665
Hello. I'm looking for someone.

532
36:25.745 --> 36:26.665
Who are you looking for?

533
36:26.745 --> 36:30.385
With a semester's worth of hard work and sweat,

534
36:30.465 --> 36:34.705
you submitted an answer sheet for youth.

535
36:35.545 --> 36:38.545
Aren't these your gloves? You accidentally threw them away.

536
36:38.625 --> 36:40.705
We will present awards to students…

537
36:40.785 --> 36:42.145
"Accidentally," you said?

538
36:43.065 --> 36:47.665
I saw you and your dad outside just now. Didn't he give these to you?

539
36:47.745 --> 36:50.385
Be more careful when throwing trash from now on.

540
36:50.465 --> 36:53.985
-Don't try to look cool. -I didn't want--

541
36:54.065 --> 36:56.465
Next, we have a special commendation.

542
36:56.545 --> 37:01.425
Year 1, Class 5's Gao Xing found lost items six times this semester

543
37:02.105 --> 37:04.345
and returned them to their owners

544
37:04.425 --> 37:06.145
or to the Lost and Found counter,

545
37:06.225 --> 37:09.105
bringing positive energy to our campus.

546
37:09.185 --> 37:11.425
For this, we hereby award the Special Award for Civic Virtue.

547
37:11.505 --> 37:14.105
No wonder he insisted I come to school.

548
37:14.185 --> 37:15.745
Students who won an award,

549
37:15.825 --> 37:18.345
proceed to Conference Room 201 in the administration building

550
37:18.425 --> 37:21.665
to collect your certificate and take a commemorative photo.

551
37:22.465 --> 37:23.865
You're welcome.

552
37:37.145 --> 37:40.665
DUAN SHENGYANG

553
37:40.745 --> 37:42.785
Zheng Yu, I heard from Mingsi's agent

554
37:42.865 --> 37:44.545
that you interviewed two days ago.

555
37:44.625 --> 37:46.425
He said it's close to campus.

556
37:46.505 --> 37:47.785
It's a good fit for you.

557
37:51.105 --> 37:53.225
Thank you for your help.

558
37:53.865 --> 37:55.865
You didn't come these past two days.

559
37:55.945 --> 37:57.905
So you went to an interview.

560
37:59.545 --> 38:00.865
How did it go?

561
38:01.705 --> 38:02.665
My chances are low.

562
38:03.305 --> 38:04.465
Why?

563
38:06.265 --> 38:09.905
The parent was too normal. Such good things don't happen to me.

564
38:11.305 --> 38:12.505
It's too soon to say.

565
38:12.585 --> 38:14.425
Not hearing back yet is normal.

566
38:23.945 --> 38:25.265
LU SIQUAN (STORE MANAGER)

567
38:25.345 --> 38:29.185
Last time, you said you could arrange more shifts for me.

568
38:34.265 --> 38:36.665
I think I've gained weight recently!

569
38:38.225 --> 38:40.025
-You haven't. -Nonsense.

570
38:41.065 --> 38:42.665
My old folding bed

571
38:42.745 --> 38:45.665
sinks to the ground when I lie down on it.

572
38:45.745 --> 38:47.065
Either I've gained weight,

573
38:47.145 --> 38:50.025
or it's not able to sustain weight anymore.

574
38:50.745 --> 38:52.305
Luckily, I bought a new one.

575
38:52.385 --> 38:54.625
It's quite comfortable.

576
38:54.705 --> 38:56.225
You can take the old bed.

577
38:56.305 --> 38:57.625
Use it.

578
38:57.705 --> 38:59.505
It would be a shame to toss it.

579
38:59.585 --> 39:03.385
You're skinny. It can definitely bear your weight.

580
39:08.345 --> 39:09.625
Why are you looking at me?

581
39:09.705 --> 39:12.545
It was your friend who helped me

582
39:12.625 --> 39:15.185
carry the new bed to this ward.

583
39:16.105 --> 39:16.945
My friend?

584
39:18.305 --> 39:19.145
Xiaochen.

585
39:20.745 --> 39:21.985
Chen Yanzhou?

586
39:22.945 --> 39:23.785
Has he been here?

587
39:25.145 --> 39:27.105
He seems to care about you a lot.

588
39:29.945 --> 39:30.985
It's guilt.

589
39:31.065 --> 39:32.505
Guilt?

590
39:33.585 --> 39:35.065
What has he done?

591
39:35.705 --> 39:37.345
He hasn't done anything wrong.

592
39:38.225 --> 39:41.305
He's just like every other kind person who doesn't lack money.

593
39:42.185 --> 39:43.465
When they see me,

594
39:44.265 --> 39:46.425
they can't turn a blind eye

595
39:46.505 --> 39:47.745
or feel at peace.

596
39:53.345 --> 39:56.385
PREVIEW

597
39:59.505 --> 40:01.785
MAIN POINTS AND RESEARCH DISCOVERIES

598
40:01.865 --> 40:04.745
The cell proportion is significantly higher than traditional…

599
40:06.025 --> 40:06.865
It just ended.

600
40:10.345 --> 40:11.185
What could I do?

601
40:11.265 --> 40:13.705
I just listened to her humiliate me.

602
40:14.625 --> 40:17.305
She's the boss. I'm just a lowly worker.

603
40:18.225 --> 40:19.505
What director?

604
40:20.545 --> 40:21.705
Less than trash!

605
40:26.145 --> 40:27.225
No.

606
40:27.905 --> 40:29.745
Let me tell you, I'm not drunk.

607
40:29.825 --> 40:31.425
If I were drunk, I would've hit her!

608
40:31.505 --> 40:33.025
Okay, bye.

609
41:24.385 --> 41:26.705
WU FA

610
41:34.225 --> 41:35.065
Ring me up!

611
41:49.785 --> 41:50.905
Ninety-eight yuan.

612
42:19.185 --> 42:20.865
Arrogant, are you?

613
42:22.025 --> 42:23.705
Got something to say?

614
42:23.785 --> 42:25.065
What's that look for?

615
42:25.665 --> 42:26.865
Are you mad?
